# Security rules

- Simulation only: never add real payment credentials, live provider SDKs or real banking endpoints.
- Never commit secrets. `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` holds placeholders only. Gateway settings load through `backend/gateway_api/settings.py`.
- Treat AI agents as untrusted callers: a proposal executes only if it matches the durable intent exactly.
- Never report an effect as completed or reversed without the provider's read-back.
- The audit log is append-only and hash-chained; never update or delete audit events.
